	6. a. Following board approval, within a time established by the authority and prior to the authority and an eligible business executing a project agreement, the eligible business shall demonstrate that it has obtained site plan approval and has committed financing for, and established site control of, the qualified business facility.  The chief executive officer of the business, or an equivalent officer, shall certify that all factual representations made by the business to the authority pursuant to this subsection are true under the penalty of perjury.
 
